cff-version: 1.2.0
title: PRT-DeepONet Studio
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below. If you use the
  two-dimensional half as well, please also cite Kim and Jung (2025);
  if you use the velocity informed capability (switch D or the velocity
  operator), please also cite Jo and Jung (2026). Both are listed under
  references.
type: software
version: "1.2"
date-released: "2026-09-03"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
authors:
  - given-names: Shahram
    family-names: Asgari
    email: shahram.asgari@uga.edu
    affiliation: >-
      Meile Lab, Department of Marine Sciences, University of Georgia,
      Athens, Georgia, USA
  - given-names: Christof
    family-names: Meile
    email: cmeile@uga.edu
    affiliation: >-
      Meile Lab, Department of Marine Sciences, University of Georgia,
      Athens, Georgia, USA
abstract: >-
  A geometry-aware neural operator for pore-scale reactive transport,
  together with PRT-LB, a two- and three-dimensional lattice Boltzmann
  simulator for flow, transport and biotic and abiotic reactions, and a
  desktop application covering the whole workflow from geometry generation
  through training to prediction.
keywords:
  - pore-scale reactive transport
  - neural operator
  - velocity field prediction
  - DeepONet
  - lattice Boltzmann
  - porous media
  - biofilm
  - Monod kinetics
